      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i tried the plunger thing but it didnt really do much, just some water splashed back at me. i'm nervous about taking the p-trap apart though. i dont want to break anything or make the leak worse. what should i look out for when i get that pipe off? like is there anything specific that usually causes that smell?",
